; The camera-controls hint belongs to this template (it describes
; OrbitCameraRig), not to the performance overlay. mouse_filter = 2 (IGNORE):
; a Label that consumed mouse events would eat orbit/pan/zoom input over its
; rect, because OrbitCameraRig listens on _unhandled_input.
